<title>USA: SangStat files for 2 mln shr offering.</title>
<headline>SangStat files for 2 mln shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SangStat Medical Corp on Friday said it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed public offering of two million shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said the underwriters have an over-allotment option to purchase up to an additional 300,000 shares for thirty days following the completion of the public offering.</p>
</text>
